id: transfiguration-beam
name: Transfiguration Beam
order: 18
category: mind
importance: secondary
description: >
  You can fire a magical beam that transforms characters into an object!
text: >
  Transfiguration Beam (Mind): You can fire a magical beam that transforms characters into an object!
  (1)-[Passive]: Reduce the Critical Target of your Strike Rolls for your Energy and Magic Attacks by 1.
  (2)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Transfiguration Special Maneuver (see — Special Maneuvers). For the Transfiguration Maneuver, you gain the following effects:

  * You can target any Opponent who is not at Long Range.
  * You can make a Strike Roll as if making a Magic Attack instead of a Physical Attack.

---

[passive]
# (1) The Strike Roll's Critical Target, for an Energy or Magic Attack (chat.mjs resolveAttack).
criticalTarget.energy -= 1;
criticalTarget.magic -= 1;
# (2) The Transfiguration Maneuver; refused at Long Range only, and its Clash made with the better of the Physical and
# Magic Strike.
allow maneuver.transfiguration;
allow transfiguration.beam;
